# Testing

## Setup

- Tests live in `__tests__/` at project root (`*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx`)
- Wrap renders with `renderTestWithProviders` from `__tests__/utils/helpers.tsx`
- Dropdowns: `selectDropdownOption(selectLabel, optionLabel)` helper

## Patterns

```tsx
describe('CancelTaskModal', () => {
  it('shows cancel button', () => {
    renderTestWithProviders(<CancelTaskModal />);
    expect(screen.getByRole('button', { name: /cancel/i })).toBeInTheDocument();
  });
});
```

- Query by role/label/text — avoid test IDs unless necessary
- Mock with `vi.mock`; reset between tests
- Async: `waitFor` / `userEvent`
- Mock data matches interfaces from `src/types/api.ts`

## Run

```bash
pnpm test
```
